        },
        {
          "text": "Yavolera avamwavo veve, “Inzi mbeeye ahimbi kukuza, navuzwa Nyasaye alamulinda. Alamutuliza mukivala yiki nukumuhira mukivala chayisuhizira Aburahamu, Isaka, kandi Yakobo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
