              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku Josefu yateeva avandu veve valombe liesuhiza. Yavoola, “Mundage inzi ndi lwa Nyasaye alimwimirira kuzia mukivala yicho, munyi mulakazie numuviri gwange.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
